<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2137547842"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1887716567"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Cheerleader"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Cheerleader"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:57.568"><div begin="00:15.923" end="03:31.224"><p begin="00:15.923" end="00:17.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">There's no doubt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无疑问</span></p><p begin="00:17.510" end="00:20.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">I can tell you're acting your heart out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可以看出来 你在努力表达你的内心感受</span></p><p begin="00:21.914" end="00:23.514" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">And she's addicted<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她如此沉迷 无法自拔 心里全是“我一定可以搞定他”的想法</span></p><p begin="00:23.663" end="00:29.666" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Obsessed like, "I know I can fix him" (Oh)</p><p begin="00:28.446" end="00:31.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">She's got hearts in her eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她的眼里满是爱心</span></p><p begin="00:31.748" end="00:34.788" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">And she draws me kissing other guys<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她画着我亲吻其他男生的画</span></p><p begin="00:34.946" end="00:38.006" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Her love, the type<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她的爱 属于那种</span></p><p begin="00:38.188" end="00:42.049" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Where she don't know where to draw the line (Oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法无天 不知道边界在哪里的爱</span></p><p begin="00:42.049" end="00:46.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Cheerleader<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的啦啦队长啊</span></p><p begin="00:46.745" end="00:53.389" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Thought she needed me, but I need her<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还以为她会需要我 但没想到 反而是我需要她</span></p><p begin="00:52.420" end="00:54.276" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Oh, baby, you tell me, you're singing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她想要我 告诉我我在尖叫</span></p><p begin="00:54.424" end="00:59.186" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">It's not fair<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不公平</span></p><p begin="00:59.264" end="01:02.883" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">'Cause I knew you like the back of my hands<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我对你了如指掌</span></p><p begin="01:06.806" end="01:12.115" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Well, don't you care? I gave you everything, ah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你难道一点都不在乎吗</span></p><p begin="01:12.289" end="01:15.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Now I feel you even when you're not there<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在即使你不在我身边 我也能感受到你的存在</span></p><p begin="01:20.389" end="01:21.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">It's kinda sad how<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有一点伤感</span></p><p begin="01:22.186" end="01:25.357" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">It's not your fault you're living in a madhouse<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你住进了疯人院里 这怎么不是你的错呢</span></p><p begin="01:26.844" end="01:28.373" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">I can't back down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能退缩</span></p><p begin="01:28.486" end="01:34.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Aren't you tired of blending into the background? (Oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你不厌倦融入背景中 成为透明人吗？</span></p><p begin="01:33.286" end="01:36.373" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">She's got hearts in her eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她眼中充满爱心</span></p><p begin="01:36.543" end="01:39.493" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Saying, "Boy, you better watch the time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她说 男孩 你最好注意一下时间</span></p><p begin="01:39.780" end="01:42.828" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">'Cause if you're not mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为如果你不属于我</span></p><p begin="01:43.244" end="01:46.925" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">I'd rather see you burned alive," oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那我情愿看着你欲火焚身而死</span></p><p begin="01:46.925" end="01:51.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Cheerleader<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦队长说她恨我 因为</span></p><p begin="01:51.607" end="01:58.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Says she hates me 'cause I'm not hers</p><p begin="01:57.260" end="01:59.189" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Oh, baby, you tell me, you're singing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她渴望着我 撕心裂肺地呐喊着</span></p><p begin="01:59.286" end="02:03.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">It's not fair<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她想要我 告诉我我在尖叫</span></p><p begin="02:04.128" end="02:07.748" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">'Cause I knew you like the back of my hands<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我对你了如指掌</span></p><p begin="02:11.682" end="02:16.995" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Well, don't you care? I gave you everything, ah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你难道一点都不在乎吗</span></p><p begin="02:17.163" end="02:20.563" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Now I feel you even when you're not there<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在即使你不在我身边 我也能感受到你的存在</span></p><p begin="02:25.689" end="02:30.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Somehow, I don't even know what she does now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知为何</span></p><p begin="02:31.684" end="02:37.761" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Well, do I wish her the best or do I actually miss her?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是希望她过得好呢</span></p><p begin="02:38.210" end="02:41.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">She had hearts in her eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她眼中充满爱心</span></p><p begin="02:41.463" end="02:44.346" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">She was rooting for me all the time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她一直在支持我</span></p><p begin="02:44.642" end="02:47.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Her love, the type<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她的爱是那种让你献出一生的爱</span></p><p begin="02:48.122" end="02:50.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">That makes you dedicate your life</p><p begin="02:50.765" end="02:55.762" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Oh, my cheerleader<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">噢</span></p><p begin="02:56.382" end="03:02.847" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Thought she needed me, but I need her<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还以为她需要我</span></p><p begin="03:04.113" end="03:08.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">It's not fair<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这不公平</span></p><p begin="03:08.945" end="03:12.551" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">'Cause I knew you like the back of my hands<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我对你了如指掌</span></p><p begin="03:16.503" end="03:21.853" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Well, don't you care? I gave you everything, ah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你难道一点都不在乎吗</span></p><p begin="03:22.001" end="03:25.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Now I feel you even when you're not there<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在即使你不在我身边 我也能感受到你的存在</span></p><p begin="03:28.480" end="03:31.224" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Yeah, I feel you even when you're not there<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在即使你不在我身边 我也能感受到你的存在</span></p></div></body></tt>